The enrichment fetch is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the linker rejects any other import. The fetch needs `aap:caps/http-client` added to the grant itself, and until that happens the node can't make the call. The output is unchanged.

